elonging to topic 18.\n3. **Assessment ID 15039**: Student 1631 answered question 381 incorrectly at level 4, categorized under topic 18.\n4. **Assessment ID 4271**: Student 1248 answered question 234 incorrectly at level 4, belonging to topic 18.\n5. **Assessment ID 6675**: Student 1363 answered question 421 incorrectly at level 4, also in topic 18.\n\nAll of these assessment records connect through their respective questions to the same topic record (ID 18, \"Linear Algebra\"). Each assessment independently confirms that \"Linear Algebra\" should appear in the result set, as they represent separate instances of students answering level 4 questions in this subject area with a value of -1.\n\nThe connections flow from assessment records to question content (via the question identifier) and then to subject topics (via the topic classification), specifically filtering for those assessments where the answer value is -1 and the question difficulty is level 4."
